  "limitation": "Observed historical leadership only. All history was previously consulted. Selection spans 104 neural/configuration policies across 9 adaptively motivated experiments plus earlier research. Repeated searches for a numerical target make the selected score optimistic. Intervals are not search adjusted. Focused policies repeat one white set, and repeated tickets do not create independent drawings. No established future advantage.",
